  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3004.04 Issuance of an ERC Certificate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3004.04 Issuance of an ERC Certificate. The department shall issue the certificate in the name of:\n\n(a) The permit holder for a permitted stationary source; or\n\n(b) The person who applied for the certified ERCs for an area source, a mobile source, or a stationary source which is exempt from permitting requirements pursuant to RSA 125-C.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3000.html"
}
